          "Do not take white homeowner defection for granted; at 30.21% white and 70% Democratic, roughly 12-15% of white voters are actively choosing Democrats, and losing even a few percentage points of this group compounds over time—maintain visible engagement with neighborhood concerns (property taxes, public safety, schools) where white homeowners concentrate.",
