          "Engage the Asian-plurality plurality and multicultural diversity with specific, non-tokenistic constituent service — 29.62% Asian, 28.99% White, 10.49% Hispanic/Latino, plus ~30% other means no single ethnic or racial community commands a majority; governing requires authentic attention to the distinct economic and social concerns of each constituency, not generic appeals to diversity.",
          "Address urban infrastructure and service delivery with competence — the 30.2% college-attainment, $93,612-income constituency expects functioning public transportation, quality public schools, healthcare access, and reliable utilities, and will evaluate the representative on whether state government is delivering these basics or whether they are deteriorating.",
